<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">A SMALL SURPRISE FOR YOU</view><view class="heading">宝箱广场</view><view class="muted">离开页面也能继续计时，不用留在这里等待</view><view class="notice">开发演示 · 不播放真实广告，不产生收入或真实现金奖励。</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}" bindtap="load">{{error}} · 点击重试</view>
  <view class="card"><view class="row"><text class="title">暖心宝箱</text><text class="pill">基础＋运营补贴</text></view><view class="chest-stage"><view class="envelope"><view class="seal">享</view></view><view class="reward">{{config.chestBase || 0}} ＋ {{config.subsidyCoins || 0}} 金币</view><view class="muted">当前规则展示，领取前以任务确认金额为准</view><view class="timer">{{timer}}</view><view class="muted">{{remaining ? '下一份小惊喜正在准备' : '宝箱已准备好'}}</view></view><view class="progress"><view class="progress-bar" style="width:{{progress}}%"></view></view><button class="button" data-kind="chest" bindtap="claim" disabled="{{busy || remaining > 0 || config.adProvider !== 'demo'}}">{{config.adProvider !== 'demo' ? '广告尚未接入' : remaining ? '等待宝箱准备完成' : '开启演示宝箱'}}</button><view class="muted space">单次只保留一个领取机会，不无限叠加。关闭页面不会扣除已获得金币。</view></view>
  <view class="card lavender"><view class="row"><text class="title">成长福袋</text><text class="pill">固定奖励 · 非抽奖</text></view><view class="reward space">{{config.bagBase || 0}} ＋ {{config.subsidyCoins || 0}} 金币</view><view class="muted">明确奖励，不设置随机中奖概率</view><button class="button light" data-kind="bag" bindtap="claim" disabled="{{busy || bagRemaining > 0 || config.adProvider !== 'demo'}}">{{bagRemaining ? bagRemaining + '秒后可领取' : '体验演示福袋'}}</button></view>
  <button wx:if="{{config.mode === 'development'}}" class="button secondary" bindtap="skip">开发工具：推进倒计时</button><view class="footer">开发工具仅用于测试，生产模式关闭</view>
</view>
